      "durationSeconds": 7.799167
    },
    {
      "id": "forest-x6",
      "key": "micro-forest-x6",
      "text": "爬树。用上下键移动，找到木牌上说的那根树枝，按确定键停在那里。",
      "textSha256": "a7bc8fa0b083e9488c05e31914f5faa5e2553b07aed0653cd9d0944bb3d9eea8",
