      "id": "music-x2",
      "key": "micro-music-x2",
      "text": "音符排队。按一到五让音符依次排队。用左右键选。按确定键排队。",
      "textSha256": "b0a0726b6ea7204e4a1920537099b7ebbbba4873d687c2d7ec161cb0b25c0dc7",
      "audio": "micro-music-x2.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 49086,
      "audioSha256": "db4cbe7a5a4b71f882d5cd0229c0f1b2ac999a6d9e01ea0fdcb3f801303de64e",
      "durationSeconds": 7.338917
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x3",
      "key": "micro-music-x3",
      "text": "乐器记忆。翻牌配对，找到三对乐器。用方向键选。按确定键翻牌。",
      "textSha256": "1be4d292ccb1aef02ff18181136885ee6c9fe08191360dc557959fcab23ca4ce",
      "audio": "micro-music-x3.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 45777,
      "audioSha256": "32678b272c92c720eec5e95177575434b6ee72c5d4f41a7c7e96aed1e674898e",
      "durationSeconds": 6.756917
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x4",
      "key": "micro-music-x4",
      "text": "指挥棒。看准绿色拍点按确定键，连打三拍。",
      "textSha256": "6d48d94ec08b657df657aa6a76826513dcf14c425360fc9b34e9d23250858ecd",
      "audio": "micro-music-x4.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 30480,
      "audioSha256": "d6ca50b97674db1ac7f89cf8b892a5c46c5d0057e25cbe0922df206178b176b7",
      "durationSeconds": 4.100875
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x5",
      "key": "micro-music-x5",
      "text": "音高滑梯。上下移动音高，停到目标音符。按确定键定音。",
      "textSha256": "a97db8f545e973d3219726f5e4635fe819ac7220f2e922043fd11735d372053d",
      "audio": "micro-music-x5.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 45570,
      "audioSha256": "a47119bd6e99be30d5cc31531756e9e841704d2023b43ea71a85a2834d7c425e",
      "durationSeconds": 6.847083
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x6",
      "key": "micro-music-x6",
      "text": "泡泡节拍。看准泡泡到节拍线时按确定键。",
      "textSha256": "148fc635b13c169da7335fd56b2884cacd4b8e9714d0fe239c2e86a646f10bb5",
      "audio": "micro-music-x6.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 28044,
      "audioSha256": "42ec573c9fcc9fd437a458edf5defe11674baa4da030fbebe9aec443ab51d10c",
      "durationSeconds": 3.731167
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x7",
      "key": "micro-music-x7",
      "text": "鼓点连击。跟着鼓点节奏按确定键连击四次。",
      "textSha256": "2599dc1bf5f92dc817a29c3a1f3f310d603051c3b701cfc087f9eac25111122e",
      "audio": "micro-music-x7.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 33666,
      "audioSha256": "8a3f5bbf01b26f9782dc6e6a050a2336802bef6295db2758506c271c4468490d",
      "durationSeconds": 4.507083
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x8",
      "key": "micro-music-x8",
      "text": "音乐迷宫。五乘五迷宫按一到五走到舞台。用方向键选。",
      "textSha256": "0d504ee7afb58ba81e64f4b8b7c40cdd92a2cb50f08a93ff01f6b38d09f7e987",
      "audio": "micro-music-x8.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 45196,
      "audioSha256": "32ecb1a3ea1e6ef3c9ff9adde47059f498628ef1ebdc399c8dcb1c53bebbc88b",
      "durationSeconds": 6.4
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x9",
      "key": "micro-music-x9",
      "text": "合唱顺序。交换小歌手，按 1、2、3 站好。用左右键选。按确定键交换。",
      "textSha256": "33c8678440c928cc65dff66d696b99ba262ba0dcc79b60e5b73a3266c79ec0d7",
      "audio": "micro-music-x9.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 51889,
      "audioSha256": "4119143bebf3dc90e9da359d3be99f4ac90dca599f6fd5666de806b7d0237c66",
      "durationSeconds": 7.606208
    },
    {
      "id": "music-x10",
      "key": "micro-music-x10",
      "text": "舞台终章。用方向键按舞台提示完成四步演出。",
      "textSha256": "2a65d984762ad43f526c0a37c70bd7e4f9d5dd4cc484bdcaeab77320243ed5d5",
      "audio": "micro-music-x10.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 32436,
      "audioSha256": "b8c30c6d52c3c24ec3369cf08d246cea1f9ca77429ec98a897f0c16accf5d5a3",
      "durationSeconds": 4.4685
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x1",
      "key": "micro-donut-x1",
      "text": "甜甜圈装盒。用方向键选格子，按确定键放一个或取一个，正好装满。",
      "textSha256": "59938e78114247ec086affe64d1ece04bacf797f9ad7b563c9db2a88f537a63e",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x1.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 47231,
      "audioSha256": "7df2fe8bb401edcdc01eae57f5289f82fc3015f1edaa6476da063dcb191e64a9",
      "durationSeconds": 6.830458
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x2",
      "key": "micro-donut-x2",
      "text": "传送带接糖。左右移动盒子，接住落下的甜甜圈。",
      "textSha256": "08c2022f6c10e57a8a0440b676be1ca88ba312185b8364b4581c2b6d5cd66781",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x2.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 32747,
      "audioSha256": "9550c76cff0fd3d943bb4af49fbfe4b02b88c842da43cb243cb8765cecbf039e",
      "durationSeconds": 4.545
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x3",
      "key": "micro-donut-x3",
      "text": "糖霜图案。按糖霜颜色顺序复现图案。用左右键选。按确定键挤糖霜。",
      "textSha256": "477d7ba4d8530bffb340fa0ac5aaf9923703878566d175705659f02a8215c0ba",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x3.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 51470,
      "audioSha256": "e5758f2572c7269f93c76f7cb3134e46332ddaab43d4c4f8f93ed74dc219c960",
      "durationSeconds": 7.615792
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x4",
      "key": "micro-donut-x4",
      "text": "平分甜甜圈。左右把甜甜圈分到两个盘子，让两边一样多。",
      "textSha256": "c00ca940e8ad94eb55a7d0852f49b5d4e0ce6cec9dee612496b3a336818b6a06",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x4.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 39911,
      "audioSha256": "d67444796f2155857141967ed413c722fcfaac55c6d2656d4a163dd69d311643",
      "durationSeconds": 5.528625
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x5",
      "key": "micro-donut-x5",
      "text": "烤箱计时。看准绿色时间按确定键出炉，一共烤两盘。",
      "textSha256": "d76c60d984c3c156b18bb8b87ee1234fd7c34271769667a2abe7cbd3c442bb4e",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x5.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 35860,
      "audioSha256": "a94a97e362e46ce924a3ba95848beb427599172d500659d4eab9c88adae23ccd",
      "durationSeconds": 5.073792
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x6",
      "key": "micro-donut-x6",
      "text": "甜甜圈堆叠。看准位置按确定键叠甜甜圈，叠五层。",
      "textSha256": "11013df013d1ddbdd4217c95d0c6ab401be0036938222d3c465ffa062accf9b7",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x6.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 41927,
      "audioSha256": "8b4bba7409784ee3df3bb905f6613fb650533fc15d73fcc11f9c2ddbdd71c671",
      "durationSeconds": 6.032625
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x7",
      "key": "micro-donut-x7",
      "text": "配料分拣。按配料数量把甜甜圈放进对应筐。用左右键选。按确定键拿起或放下。",
      "textSha256": "426a13c142e6a233fc68a14e824b04f5decb319e64dcd5172ae6ddbc83dab644",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x7.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 59335,
      "audioSha256": "0a1d2127e58a8b817ae3717fde14e1b2331c9afa83c9c0cbd4a9cb2fd47d50c7",
      "durationSeconds": 8.938125
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x8",
      "key": "micro-donut-x8",
      "text": "甜甜圈迷宫。五乘五迷宫按一到五 送到柜台。用方向键选。",
      "textSha256": "a2ba2e0865421fa253b5f81bbdb300d6bc09d2077ca431ebf411be11ee0f62a5",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x8.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 43663,
      "audioSha256": "10efe86513363c459f7fd0f794a5d35979f179a1b02e410398ce93c4be9d2216",
      "durationSeconds": 6.39475
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x9",
      "key": "micro-donut-x9",
      "text": "订单匹配。找到和订单数字对应的盒子。用左右键选。按确定键交付。",
      "textSha256": "446a5d485d747d52cf1f92e4936bce92ef5b92c3f73b34284f598469745f3a88",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x9.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 46173,
      "audioSha256": "8f93e1460e068dc8642cd74dd7ac186eba8f90b2a07b7bbe23c65b48b01d1d79",
      "durationSeconds": 6.693583
    },
    {
      "id": "donut-x10",
      "key": "micro-donut-x10",
      "text": "工厂夜班。用方向键选机器，按确定键按夜班流程操作四台机器。",
      "textSha256": "1f6cfbc25d70dab54f84f6eb25f15471fad416a76a4c502cb0732e5c74cf28aa",
      "audio": "micro-donut-x10.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 43357,
      "audioSha256": "79836a0ee9d7bf06648ef32aa31e42e12fe8ad93eb2e69cdb5264996d1745980",
      "durationSeconds": 6.274
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x1",
      "key": "micro-magic-x1",
      "text": "魔法药水。用左右键选药水，按确定键按配方颜色顺序倒四格。",
      "textSha256": "6a3e47dc7463da26002d6258779f59077372e5e7d50f3ad75fe7e6ddfb560ae4",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x1.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 42991,
      "audioSha256": "70ab8636b7ee95cdd7cf063cc720c7d8fb10fa90eee2b365cb518a4218e7264a",
      "durationSeconds": 6.287875
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x2",
      "key": "micro-magic-x2",
      "text": "变形咒。用左右键选形状，按确定键把花园变成目标图案。",
      "textSha256": "b5082818b9c3e25b6019c4c6e3d4d30e81c894ece694113bb5277cd8851f30a5",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x2.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 43207,
      "audioSha256": "8e2575f6eb5fa20822ad40c531f5f011c67608a50b65d1923b836ddbf54a9b47",
      "durationSeconds": 6.450583
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x3",
      "key": "micro-magic-x3",
      "text": "镜像花。用方向键选花镜，按确定键翻转，拼出目标图案。",
      "textSha256": "314405dfa773756f3caf966cc6f8267e1d0825d2c2cdcdf24fff4c576d87db3e",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x3.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 39737,
      "audioSha256": "927ff2fefa11224fa22e9bef4acec147ad5f6d535ebb7c92896b00effb9b30df",
      "durationSeconds": 5.7595
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x4",
      "key": "micro-magic-x4",
      "text": "魔法阵。用左右键选圈，按确定键转一下，把三个标记对齐。",
      "textSha256": "d95f5d679bec4a6a2e5e48b5ea4e34d0ec215865a3551d88858113b10872c3c2",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x4.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 39782,
      "audioSha256": "c592ee6a20453160e389219b57d804e15e26d1a76a945941be6b908937efc603",
      "durationSeconds": 5.843208
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x5",
      "key": "micro-magic-x5",
      "text": "飞天扫帚。左右飞，接住掉落的星星。",
      "textSha256": "1aa36aa5d5af6fc833b0e6734947ff1292766fe11aa3955fd27caee0021ea625",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x5.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 29094,
      "audioSha256": "2884dd643240abd946de053b5fbb4f77c5586c1816edb70760c3cf53059e303e",
      "durationSeconds": 3.925375
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x6",
      "key": "micro-magic-x6",
      "text": "魔法生物。翻牌配对三只魔法生物。用方向键选。按确定键翻牌。",
      "textSha256": "818820d19502422485fb321d594b0a97255290786ce4aa1e833d3d7ac4b05255",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x6.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 44021,
      "audioSha256": "7c49283a6c7338c972b64b1b1cfe76e0ec19ac2767fdeb9e1cac608121468aa7",
      "durationSeconds": 6.549792
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x7",
      "key": "micro-magic-x7",
      "text": "花园迷宫。五乘五花园迷宫按一到五走到喷泉。用方向键选。",
      "textSha256": "45075ee15ae11ca8fa1f1983f44c1013e97b574f567d9f32d7cd42a8fdea8f18",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x7.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 40987,
      "audioSha256": "1f8b61b25e9c37150a2c491546d681c4461ed476a5e11b139c141154162c7d01",
      "durationSeconds": 5.886667
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x8",
      "key": "micro-magic-x8",
      "text": "星星采集。在花圃里收集正好数量的星星。用方向键选。按确定键采集。",
      "textSha256": "12fddabadb8a33914bbeb39fbe85980099704db16f9880abf160451833c7b53c",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x8.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 47378,
      "audioSha256": "24b05116af1788c22bef4c17881eb0f3145d5f5f06b0f24b01f5eb9680e1a865",
      "durationSeconds": 6.920917
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x9",
      "key": "micro-magic-x9",
      "text": "魔法天平。左右加魔法花，让两边一样重。",
      "textSha256": "c53f00d70145124764326dc610e695f7093286e9ff6e36620f34767b1f6f1d6c",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x9.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 30479,
      "audioSha256": "87944d2f3cacdbc0c881414cd5a5eede18cf2505a3f79e18fb27cc4e874100ad",
      "durationSeconds": 4.188708
    },
    {
      "id": "magic-x10",
      "key": "micro-magic-x10",
      "text": "花园庆典。用方向键按庆典顺序完成四步魔法。",
      "textSha256": "7257b03271ec7ed37e76621f08975ca44e2af99dcb225c2b92dbe9272b277a44",
      "audio": "micro-magic-x10.m4a",
      "audioExists": true,
      "audioBytes": 35536,
      "audioSha256": "b365b687680e14e3312b01ef68808e5775d224b0606e7cdceb3e2d47db5ef9ed",
      "durationSeconds": 4.993708
    }
  ],
